&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our &lt;strong&gt;Mirakl Connect Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt; lead by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/jean-yves-cazac-9708b02/&quot;&gt;Jean-Yves Cazac&lt;/a&gt;, Engineering Director. The team consists of approximately 50 engineers covering the full Mirakl Connect product scope, from seller onboarding and experience to marketplace integrations and channel management. Together, you&#39;ll be shaping how sellers and brands connect, operate, and grow across multiple marketplaces worldwide.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will directly lead &lt;strong&gt;2 squads &lt;/strong&gt;— &lt;strong&gt;Seller Experience&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Channel Integration&lt;/strong&gt; — representing approximately 12 engineers based between Paris, &amp;amp; Bordeaux, with close collaboration with colleagues based in the US.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in Paris or Bordeaux office with one day of remote work per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop two engineering squads responsible for the seller journey on Mirakl Connect and integrations with external marketplaces such as Amazon, Walmart, and Zalando, ensuring reliable delivery and a high engineering bar across both teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Design to define priorities, translate business needs into execution plans, and make trade-offs that balance delivery speed, quality, and technical sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical direction of your scope — challenging architectural choices, ensuring solutions are scalable and maintainable, and raising best practices in testing, observability, and incident management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop your people: coach engineers and tech leads, identify growth opportunities, run performance and career conversations, and contribute to attracting strong talent into the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong operating model for your teams — improving ways of working pragmatically, protecting team focus, fostering ownership, and enabling effective collaboration with distributed and international stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
